      "math_academy_id": "q-270162",
      "sequence_position": 10,
      "problem": "Express $\\frac{-6{x}^{4}+{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}+x-10}{2{x}^{3}-3{x}^{2}+4x-2}$ in the form $q(x)+\\frac{r(x)}{2{x}^{3}-3{x}^{2}+4x-2},$ where $q(x)$ is the quotient and $r(x)$ is the reminder of the division.$$\n\n| $-6{x}^{4}+{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}+x-10$ | __ | {{field-1}} | $+$ | {{field-2}} |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $2{x}^{3}-3{x}^{2}+4x-2$ | __ |  |  | $2{x}^{3}-3{x}^{2}+4x-2$ |",
      "worked_solution": "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-3x-4 \\\\  & 2{x}^{3}-3{x}^{2}+4x-2\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,-6{x}^{4}+\\phantom{0}{x}^{3}-\\phantom{0}2{x}^{2}+\\phantom{00}x-10\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{\\,-\\,6{x}^{4}+9{x}^{3}-12{x}^{2}+6x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-8{x}^{3}+10{x}^{2}-5x-10 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{\\,-\\,8{x}^{3}+12{x}^{2}-16x+8}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,2{x}^{2}+11x-18\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAs a result, \n\n- the quotient is $-3x-4,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $-2{x}^{2}+11x-18.$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{-6{x}^{4}+{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}+x-10}{2{x}^{3}-3{x}^{2}+4x-2} & =-3x-4+\\frac{(-2{x}^{2}+11x-18)}{2{x}^{3}-3{x}^{2}+4x-2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
